//- A diagram that lives with the code: checked and rendered on every push
diagram(dir="right")

  card#file.src(icon="file-code") architecture.skemo
    | in the repository, reviewed in pull requests
    to(check)

  zone#ci.ci CI job
    card#check.step skemo lint
      | --deny-warnings
      to(render)
    card#render.step skemo render
      | same image on every machine
      to(png svg html)

  zone#out.out Published
    card#png.img architecture.png
      | README, wiki
    card#svg.img architecture.svg
      | docs site
    card#html.img architecture.html
      | slides, steps
